    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "After a multi-year regulatory investigation, the regulatory authority in Brussels has deemed the search engine provider's proposed remedies insufficient. The authorities are now finalizing a significant financial sanction, adding to a history of regulatory fines against the parent company. This monetary penalty outcome is anticipated before the Commission's August recess.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Sage",
        "fragments": [
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "result-0",
