      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The investigation stems from the entity with ranking practices under scrutiny allegedly self-preferencing in search results under the bloc's gatekeeper rules. Investigators have reviewed the market conduct and now move toward a formal decision. This case exemplifies the application of competition law to a dominant technology company.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Sage",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "why-1",
          "how-3"
        ],
        "center": "why-0",
        "center_kind": "why",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "element_centered",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "salience_rank": 2
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "European authorities, acting as government regulators, are poised to impose a high-hundreds-of-millions-of-euros antitrust fine. The decision follows the rejection of the company's remedy proposals and represents a major enforcement action under the digital markets framework. This financial penalty will be the latest in over a decade of sanctions.",
